g":"加载中...","filesystem.markdown-placeholder":"输入进行编辑……","filesystem.reconnecting":"正在重新连接……","filesystem.reviving":"正在恢复工作区…","filesystem.updated":"已更新 {{time}}","filesystem.updated-ago":"{{time}}前已更新","filesystem.workspace-inactive":"工作区未激活","finance-connector-upsell.cta":"添加","finance-connector-upsell.description":"连接账户以在聊天中管理您的财务","finance-connector-upsell.description-mobile":"连接金融账户。","finance-connector-upsell.dismiss":"关闭","finance-connector-upsell.title":"金融","free-usage-after-limit-banner.build.message":"您已达到您的 {{limit}} — 继续使用免费额度构建，或升级以获得更高限额。","free-usage-after-limit-banner.chat.message":"您已达到您的 {{limit}} — 继续使用免费额度聊天，或升级以获得更高限额。","free-usage-after-limit-banner.cta":"升级","free-usage-after-limit-banner.daily.limit":"每日限额","free-usage-after-limit-banner.dismiss":"关闭","free-usage-after-limit-banner.generic.limit":"用量限额","free-usage-after-limit-banner.imagine.message":"您已达到您的 {{limit}} — 使用免费额度继续生成，或升级以获得更高限额。","free-usage-after-limit-banner.monthly.limit":"月度限额","free-usage-after-limit-banner.voice.message":"您已达到您的 {{limit}} — 使用免费额度继续对话，或升级以获得更高限额。","free-usage-after-limit-banner.weekly.limit":"每周限额","gateway-connection-banner.dismiss-button.label":"忽略","gateway-connection-banner.generic":"Grok 的实时连接出现问题。在连接恢复之前，消息可能无法发送。","gateway-connection-banner.retry-button.label":"重试","gateway-connection-banner.sign-in-button.label":"登录","gateway-connection-banner.testing-connection":"检测到网络问题。正在测试您的连接…","gateway-connection-banner.unauthorized":"您的会话已结束。请重新登录。","gateway-connection-banner.unreachable":"目前无法访问 Grok。请检查您的互联网连接。","gateway-connection-banner.websocket-blocked":"你的网络或安全软件阻止了 Grok 的实时连接。请尝试切换网络，或联系 IT 团队允许与 {{host}} 建立 WebSocket 连接。","gateway-new-conversation-error.description":"连接失败。请重试。","gateway-new-conversation-error.error-code":"错误代码：{{errorCode}}","gateway-new-conversation-error.retry-button":"重试","gateway-new-conversation-error.sign-in-button":"登录","gateway-new-conversation-error.start-over-button":"重新开始","gateway-new-conversation-error.testing-connection":"正在测试您的连接…","gateway-new-conversation-error.title":"无法开始对话","gateway-new-conversation-error.unauthorized":"您的会话已结束。请重新登录。","gateway-new-conversation-error.unreachable":"目前无法访问 Grok。请检查您的互联网连接，然后重试。","gateway-new-conversation-error.websocket-blocked":"您的网络正在阻止 Grok 所需的实时连接。使用 VPN、公司或酒店网络，或安全软件时，都可能出现这种情况。请尝试切换到其他网络，或联系您的 IT 团队，允许与 {{host}} 建立 WebSocket 连接。这不是您的账户出现了问题。","generated-images-card.title":"生成的图像","go to next sent message":"下一条消息","go to previously sent message":"上一条消息","google-drive-picker.file-tab.all":"全部","google-drive-picker.file-tab.owned-by-me":"我拥有的","google-drive-picker.folder.untitled":"未命名的文件夹","grok-bot-button.aria-label":"打开 Grok Bot","grok-bot-button.download-aria-label":"下载 Grok Bot","grok-bot-button.label":"Grok Bot","grok-bot-button.upgrade-aria-label":"通过 SuperGrok Heavy 获取 Grok Bot","grok-bot-button.upgrade-aria-label-v2":"通过 {{planName}} 获取 Grok Bot","grok-bot-post-purchase.close.aria-label":"关闭","grok-bot-post-purchase.description":"你可以委派实际工作的 AI 队友。机器人可以登录到你的工具，像你一样使用它们，并带回已完成的工作。SuperGrok Heavy 专享。","grok-bot-post-purchase.description-v2":"你可以委派实际工作的 AI 队友。机器人可以登录到你的工具，像你一样使用它们，并带回已完成的工作。包含在 {{planName}} 中。","grok-bot-post-purchase.download-button.label":"下载","grok-bot-post-purchase.download-button.outlink-label":"获取 Grok Bot","grok-bot-post-purchase.learn-more-button.label":"了解更多","grok-bot-post-purchase.title":"开始使用 Grok Bot","grok-bot-post-purchase.wordmark":"Grok Bot","grok-bot-upsell.cta":"下载","grok-bot-upsell.cta-outlink":"获取 Grok Bot","grok-bot-upsell.cta-upgrade":"升级","grok-bot-upsell.description":"你可以委以实际工作的 AI 队友。他们像你一样使用你的工具。","grok-bot-upsell.description-mobile":"处理实际工作的 AI 队友。","grok-bot-upsell.dismiss":"忽略","grok-bot-upsell.title":"认识 Grok Bot","grok-build-modal.badge":"免费试用","grok-build-modal.close":"关闭","grok-build-modal.copy-command":"复制安装命令","grok-build-modal.feature-grok-4-6-description":"专为编程和智能体任务打造的全新模型现已成为默认模型。","grok-build-modal.feature-grok-4-6-title":"Grok 4.6","grok-build-modal.feature-imagine-description":"为你的网站和应用生成或编辑图像和视频。","grok-build-modal.feature-imagine-title":"Imagine","grok-build-modal.feature-multi-agent-loops-title":"多智能体循环","grok-build-modal.feature-subagents-description":"在独立上下文窗口中创建并行代理。","grok-build-modal.install-hint":"复制并粘贴到终端以尝试","grok-build-modal.install-platform":"安装平台","grok-build-modal.subtitle-grok-4-6-supergrok":"可在终端中运行的编程代理，现由 Grok 4.6（我们的新模型）提供支持。SuperGrok 和 X Premium+ 订阅用户可抢先体验。","grok-build-modal.subtitle-grok-4-6-terminal":"直接在您的终端中使用前沿智能进行开发，现在由 Grok 4.6 提供支持。","grok-build-modal.title":"Grok Build","grok-build-video.badge":"新建","grok-build-video.close":"关闭","grok-build-video.title-v2":"Grok Build 中的 Grok 4.6","grok-build-video.trigger-subtitle":"我们的新模型","grok-build-video.trigger-title-v2":"了解 Grok 4.6","hidden-attachment-name":"隐藏附件","image-gen.editing":"编辑图像中…","image-gen.error":"无法生成图像","image-gen.generated-image-alt":"生成的图像","image-gen.generating":"生成图片中…","image-gen.moderated-subtitle":"你的想法未通過審核。\\n請換個試試。","image-gen.moderated-title":"我们无法生成此图像","image-gen.rate-limited-subtitle":"您已用完您的图像生成次数。\\n请稍后再试。","image-gen.rate-limited-title":"图像限额已达","image-gen.rate-limited-upgrade-btn.label":"升级","image-gen.render-per-message-limit-exceeded-subtitle":"此回复中的一些图像无法显示。\\n发送一条新消息以获取更多。","image-gen.render-per-message-limit-exceeded-title":"图片生成已达上限","image-gen.system-error-subtitle":"我们无法生成图像。\\n请再试一次。","image-gen.system-error-title":"出了点问题","image-generation-card.title":"生成的图片","image-viewer.close":"关闭","image-viewer.copied-image":"图片已复制到剪贴板！","image-viewer.copied-link":"图片链接已复制到剪贴板！","image-viewer.copy-image":"复制","image-viewer.download-image":"下载","image-viewer.error":"图片加载失败","image-viewer.image":"图片","image-viewer.next":"下一个","image-viewer.previous":"上一个","image-viewer.view-link":"查看链接","image-viewer.view-source":"查看来源","images-card.title":"图片查询：{{query}}","kicanvas.load-error":"无法加载原理图查看器。","mcp-app.close":"关闭","message-bubble.sender-grok":"Grok","message-bubble.sender-system":"系统","message-bubble.sender-you":"你","model-steer-option-c